 \"mastery-set-scope\", \"concept\": \"resolve every cross-file reference inside its own Mastery set\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"note\", \"detail\": \"D23 Mastery e24c070d: `4c1097.py` existed in all 7 sets; a bundle-wide index returned set1's handoff id for sets 2-7 (6 rejected). Index per inner evidence-0N.zip; cases must keep set-distinct values. D24: stems identical across all 8 sets again (`588efb.jsp` set1..set8) with set-distinct plans; the D23 per-set fix held (Mastery 2afec5c3 first try). D25: 9 sets, stems again identical across sets (`a7470f.exs` set1..set9); first try. D26 10 sets, D27 11 sets (semantic ids `setN.<lang>-<role>-<field>`); first try both days.\"},\n  {\"id\": \"timed-contract-shape-diff\", \"concept\": \"diff the timed contract's id grammar against the single's before trusting the carried solver\", \"priority\": 1, \"action\": \"note\", \"detail\": \"D23: single = semantic ids, timed = per-file hashed ids + composite fields; answered/asked dropped to 593/1495 and cost ~25 min across TT+Mastery. A pre-run check (answered ratio < 0.98 on a fresh contract => generalize","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"persistedOutputPath":"/home/testpwn/.claude/projects/-home-testpwn-huntress-2026/fc465c25-ecfc-4ec8-b6ef-a673059d5ffb/tool-results/bxkdmwfsw.txt","persistedOutputSize":38795},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HgpKmuD7Y9bEFTJhGoWxiw","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
