at): join pieces, strip separators, THEN peel\n peel by SHAPE, max 4 layers, accept only output starting `v=` (or `{` JSON): hex (any separators) | base64 std/urlsafe\n   (also reversed text) | base32 [A-Z2-7=] | base85/ascii85 <~~> | gzip H4sI / zlib eJ eN eF | rot13 | %xx | \\xNN \\NNN \\ddd\n   \\uXXXX \\u{..} | int lists (READ the radix from code) | UTF-16LE inside b64 (PS -enc: every 2nd byte 00)\n D23 `LYR-<l1>_<l2>_<l3>-data` = ENCODE layers (b64 b32 hex rev frag): undo last-first; obfuscation answer = layer string\n copy plan values verbatim (role, attack, adapter, steps, profiles, next_language); never derive them from code or a known list\nTIMED CONTRACT GRAMMAR: D23-D26 ids `<family>-<6hex>-<field>` over `<6hex>.<ext>` members -> route by field; composite fields =\n labels joined by `|` in the question's order; indicator = first present in the question's order; campaign-token = after 1st\n `-`; url-host/path-leaf from plan url/file_path; cross-file ids (handoff-id) resolved PER MASTERY SET. Diff id grammar first.\n D27 REVERTED: timed = single semantic ids (TT 1659, M 11x1659), no LYR -- keep BOTH grammars; next_language pool gone -> siblings.\nLAYERED OBFUSCATION -> standard tool (static, no network, no exec of behaviour):\n PowerShell   .venv/bin/ps1 < f  (folds -f reorder, `ticks, 'a'+'b', [char]N, -join, -replace, .Invoke)\n JS           webcrack f.js -o out/  (obfuscator.io arrays) | .venv/bin/js < f | node hctf/js_sandbox.js f (eval->capture)\n VBA/VBS      .venv/bin/olevba --decode --deobf f | .venv/bin/vba < f.bas | pcodedmp f.doc (stomped p-code)\n Batch        .venv/bin/bat < f  (emulates set/%x:~a,b%/%x:a=b%/^/delayed !x!; prints commands, runs nothing)\n XLM xlmdeobf | OneNote xtone -l | CHM xtchm -l | LNK lnk | AutoIt autoit-ripper | Python: exec->print under python3 -I, marshal->pycdc\n compressed   .venv/bin/b64 < blob | .venv/bin/decompress   (gzip/zlib/raw deflate/lzma/bz2 auto)\n PHP chains   apply the named functions innermost-first in 